      <description>&lt;p&gt;Q: Is &lt;a href=&#34;http://buytaert.net/&#34;&gt;Dries&lt;/a&gt; your Brother ?&lt;br&gt;&#xA;A: No he isn&amp;rsquo;t.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Q: Are you related to &lt;a href=&#34;http://buytaert.net/&#34;&gt;Dries&lt;/a&gt; ?&lt;br&gt;&#xA;A: No we aren&amp;rsquo;t (as far as we know)&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Q: Do you know &lt;a href=&#34;http://buytaert.net/&#34;&gt;Dries&lt;/a&gt; ?&lt;br&gt;&#xA;A: Yeah .. I&amp;rsquo;ve known him since before he started his work on Drupal, now can you stop asking about Dries and refocus on me ?&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Q: Are you related to Thomas Buytaert&lt;br&gt;&#xA;A: No.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Q: Why are you sdog on irc ?&lt;br&gt;&#xA;A: Back in my DemoScene days my nick was Sleeping Dog , whch was too long for a unix account name , sleeping didn&amp;rsquo;t feel like a good choice and neither did dog, so the abbrev became sdog&lt;/p&gt;</description>
